00:20:43,883 --> 00:20:46,970
He insisted on talking to this bloody Babadook thing all day .

260
00:20:47,053 --> 00:20:49,222
Just talking to the air ... even freaked me out .

261
00:20:49,306 --> 00:20:50,265
I 'm so sorry .

262
00:20:50,348 --> 00:20:51,725
You need to get him to see someone , Amelia .

263
00:20:51,808 --> 00:20:53,643
