271
00:21:13,913 --> 00:21:15,665
Well , I 'm not scared .

272
00:21:15,749 --> 00:21:18,793
You will be when it creeps into your room at night .

273
00:21:18,877 --> 00:21:20,462
That 's enough .

274
00:21:20,545 --> 00:21:23,048
You will be when it eats your insides .

275
00:21:23,131 --> 00:21:25,759
I 've decided you 're not having your birthday with Ruby this week .

276
00:21:25,842 --> 00:21:27,761
No cake , no games . That 's the end of it .

277
00:21:32,223 --> 00:21:33,683
Samuel .

278
00:21:33,767 --> 00:21:35,477
