288
00:22:29,572 --> 00:22:31,366
I was just putting something back .

289
00:22:31,449 --> 00:22:33,827
- All your father 's things are down there . - He 's my father .

290
00:22:33,910 --> 00:22:36,246
- You don 't own him ! - ( KNOCK AT DOOR )

291
00:22:37,747 --> 00:22:40,208
Just thought I 'd see how you 're going .

292
00:22:43,461 --> 00:22:45,005
Can I come in ?

293
00:22:46,131 --> 00:22:49,175
Hey , matey . This is for you .

294
00:22:49,259 --> 00:22:51,970
My mum always got me a model plane when I was sick . ( LAUGHS )

295
00:22:52,053 --> 00:22:53,763
I 'm not sick .

296
00:22:55,181 --> 00:22:57,434
Oh . I-I thought ...

297
00:22:57,517 --> 00:22:59,102
