298
00:22:59,185 --> 00:23:02,188
The truth is he 's so disobedient he can 't go to school anymore .

299
00:23:02,272 --> 00:23:03,231
You said that 's not true .

300
00:23:03,315 --> 00:23:04,774
How many 6-year-old boys do you know , Robbie ,

301
00:23:04,858 --> 00:23:06,901
- who still believe in monsters ? - I hate you !

302
00:23:06,985 --> 00:23:11,615
She won 't let me have a birthday party and she won 't let me have a dad !

303
00:24:00,956 --> 00:24:02,958
( GASPS )

304
00:24:18,848 --> 00:24:20,809
Ohh .

305
00:24:25,397 --> 00:24:26,856
Don 't eat it .

306
00:24:39,661 --> 00:24:41,788
The Babadook did it , Mum .

307
00:24:43,248 --> 00:24:44,749
Go and watch a DVD and I 'll make something else .

308
00:24:44,833 --> 00:24:48,086
- The Babadook did it ! - Just go and watch a DVD , Samuel .

309
00:24:48,169 --> 00:24:52,841
MAN : ( ON TV ) Ladies and gentlemen , girls and boys ,

310
00:24:52,924 --> 00:24:58,305
welcome to the great Martin 's DVD ' School of Magic ' .

311
00:24:58,388 --> 00:25:01,391
Life is not always as it seems .

312
00:25:01,474 --> 00:25:05,520
It can be a wondrous thing .

313
00:25:05,604 --> 00:25:09,566
But it can also be very treacherous .

314
00:25:09,649 --> 00:25:11,901
In this DVD ,

315
00:25:11,985 --> 00:25:16,531
you will learn magic tricks to surprise , to delight

316
00:25:16,615 --> 00:25:22,454
and perhaps even shock your family and friends .

317
00:25:45,644 --> 00:25:47,604
