327
00:27:03,888 --> 00:27:06,224
( PANTS )

328
00:27:12,105 --> 00:27:14,608
Don 't let it in ! Don 't let it in !

329
00:27:14,691 --> 00:27:18,320
Don 't let it in ! Don 't let it in ! Don 't let it in !

330
00:27:18,403 --> 00:27:20,405
Don 't let it in !

331
