368
00:30:43,191 --> 00:30:45,652
- It 'd rip her arms off . - Shut up !

369
00:30:45,735 --> 00:30:48,863
They feel sorry for me , Claire . There 's a big difference .

370
00:30:48,947 --> 00:30:51,283
God , Amelia , as soon as anyone mentions Oskar , you can 't cope .

371
00:30:51,366 --> 00:30:53,868
- That 's not true . - It 'll be seven years .

372
00:30:53,952 --> 00:30:55,328
Isn 't it time you moved on ?

373
00:30:55,412 --> 00:30:56,871
I have moved on .

374
00:30:56,955 --> 00:31:00,333
I don 't mention him . I don 't talk about him .

375
00:31:00,417 --> 00:31:02,460
What strain is that on you , Claire ?

376
00:31:02,544 --> 00:31:05,255
RUBY : You 're not even good enough to have a dad .

377
00:31:05,338 --> 00:31:07,299
Everyone else has one and you don 't .

378
00:31:07,382 --> 00:31:08,967
I do have a dad !

379
00:31:09,050 --> 00:31:11,845
I listen to your life day in , day out ,

380
00:31:11,928 --> 00:31:14,931
and you never stop to ask me anything about mine .

381
00:31:15,015 --> 00:31:17,559
I do ! I want to know how you are .

382
00:31:17,684 --> 00:31:19,603
You don 't come round to our house anymore .

383
00:31:19,686 --> 00:31:21,813
Because I can 't stand being around your son .

384
00:31:21,896 --> 00:31:24,441
I can 't believe you just said that .

385
00:31:24,524 --> 00:31:26,985
You can 't stand being around him yourself .

386
00:31:27,068 --> 00:31:29,487
RUBY : Your dad died so he didn 't have to be with you .

387
00:31:29,571 --> 00:31:32,198
- That 's not true ! - And your mum doesn 't want you .

388
00:31:32,282 --> 00:31:34,826
- No-one wants you . - ( GRUNTS )

389
