( THUD )

390
00:31:37,412 --> 00:31:39,331
( CRIES )

391
00:31:45,712 --> 00:31:46,838
What did you do ? !

392
00:31:46,922 --> 00:31:49,799
She said I didn 't have a dad . She kept saying it .

393
00:31:51,217 --> 00:31:52,761
Is she alright ?

394
00:31:52,844 --> 00:31:57,474
Stay here and look after the children or do you want another one to get hurt ?

395
00:31:57,557 --> 00:32:02,562
SAMUEL : ( SCREAMS ) Mummy ! She wouldn 't believe me !

396
00:32:02,646 --> 00:32:05,065
Mummy ! Mummy !

397
00:32:05,148 --> 00:32:06,983
( SHRIEKS ) Mummy !

398
00:32:07,067 --> 00:32:10,987
- Mummy ! Mummy ! - Why can 't you just be normal ? !

399
00:32:11,071 --> 00:32:12,572
( SCREAMS )

400
00:32:12,656 --> 00:32:14,866
There is no Babadook !

401
00:32:14,950 --> 00:32:16,618
( SCREAMS )

402
00:32:16,701 --> 00:32:19,162
Get out !

403
00:32:21,623 --> 00:32:24,209
- Get out ! - Samuel ?

404
00:32:24,292 --> 00:32:26,461
- Mummy ! - Stop this now !

405
00:32:26,544 --> 00:32:29,339
Get out ! Get out ! Get out !

406
00:32:29,422 --> 00:32:32,259
( SCREAMS )

407
00:32:48,608 --> 00:32:49,776
Please help me !

408
00:32:49,859 --> 00:32:52,237
There 's something wrong with my son .

409
00:33:03,915 --> 00:33:07,043
I think it may have been a febrile convulsion .

410
00:33:07,127 --> 00:33:08,920
That 's when the brain overheats .

411
00:33:09,004 --> 00:33:12,132
- It always looks worse than it is . - I 've never seen anything like this .

412
00:33:12,215 --> 00:33:14,217
We 'll have to wait until the tests come back .

413
00:33:14,301 --> 00:33:16,011
All his other results are normal .

414
00:33:16,094 --> 00:33:20,181
He 's obviously suffering a high level of anxiety .

415
00:33:20,265 --> 00:33:21,933
Very committed to the monster theory .

416
00:33:22,017 --> 00:33:23,602
That 's an understatement .

417
00:33:24,519 --> 00:33:27,063
All children see monsters .

418
00:33:27,147 --> 00:33:29,107
Not like this .

419
00:33:30,233 --> 00:33:32,235
And it 's getting worse .

420
00:33:32,319 --> 00:33:34,946
He 's becoming aggressive .

421
00:33:35,030 --> 00:33:36,531
He could see a psychiatrist .

422
00:33:36,615 --> 00:33:38,158
I can refer you .

423
00:33:38,241 --> 00:33:39,743
Takes a few weeks to get in .

424
00:33:39,826 --> 00:33:41,244
That 'd be great .

425
00:33:42,954 --> 00:33:46,207
But can you just give me something for now ,

426
00:33:46,291 --> 00:33:48,960
just to make him sleep ?

427
00:33:49,878 --> 00:33:51,713
Um , just until ...

428
00:33:52,797 --> 00:33:55,175
just until we get an appointment .

429
00:33:56,176 --> 00:33:58,261
Please ?

430
00:33:58,345 --> 00:34:03,058
I haven 't slept in weeks and neither has Samuel

431
00:34:03,141 --> 00:34:06,478
and when we go home tonight , this whole nightmare will start up again

432
00:34:06,561 --> 00:34:07,729
and I am really ...

433
00:34:07,812 --> 00:34:10,899
I 'm really not coping .

434
00:34:12,943 --> 00:34:17,489
I can give you a short course of sedatives .

435
00:34:17,572 --> 00:34:19,908
Just until the tests come back .

436
00:34:19,991 --> 00:34:24,788
Most mothers aren 't too keen on them unless it 's really bad .

437
00:34:24,871 --> 00:34:27,082
It 's really bad .

438
00:34:34,089 --> 00:34:38,593
These can make children feel foggy .

439
00:34:38,677 --> 00:34:40,845
Perhaps some temporary nausea .

440
00:34:40,929 --> 00:34:44,057
They 'll certainly help him sleep , though .

441
00:34:44,140 --> 00:34:47,936
- That 's for one week . - Thank you .

442
00:34:49,854 --> 00:34:52,148
SAMUEL : Why don 't people like me ?

443
00:34:52,232 --> 00:34:54,234
AMELIA : Why do you say that ?

444
00:34:54,317 --> 00:34:58,446
Ruby said people don 't like me ' cause I 'm weird .

445
00:34:59,489 --> 00:35:03,660
Sometimes people say things that aren 't true .

446
00:35:07,038 --> 00:35:12,711
You just need to take your medicine , have a big sleep and not worry .

447
00:35:14,004 --> 00:35:15,714
I don 't want you to die .

448
00:35:15,797 --> 00:35:18,842
I 'm not gonna die for a long time yet .

449
00:35:18,925 --> 00:35:23,388
Did you think that about my dad before he died ?

450
00:35:27,309 --> 00:35:30,854
Just take your pill so you can go to sleep .

451
00:35:30,937 --> 00:35:33,189
I 've got the day off tomorrow .

452
00:35:33,273 --> 00:35:35,233
Maybe we could do something , hmm ?

453
00:35:35,317 --> 00:35:38,612
Will these make the Babadook go away ?

454
00:35:38,695 --> 00:35:42,198
I think so but you have to promise me not to mention it again .

455
00:35:42,282 --> 00:35:46,244
I promise to protect you if you promise to protect me .

456
00:35:46,328 --> 00:35:48,079
Then I won 't mention it .

457
00:35:48,163 --> 00:35:52,417
I promise to protect you .

458
00:35:52,500 --> 00:35:54,419
Come on .

459
00:36:05,472 --> 00:36:06,848
Come on .

460
00:36:13,146 --> 00:36:15,565
Can you stay here with me ?

461
00:36:15,649 --> 00:36:17,484
Yes .

462
00:36:17,567 --> 00:36:19,819
I love you , Mum .

463
00:36:19,903 --> 00:36:21,905
Me too .

464
00:36:32,165 --> 00:36:35,877
( EERIE MUSIC )

465
00:37:05,991 --> 00:37:09,703
( DRIPPING )

466
00:37:35,186 --> 00:37:36,938
