470
00:38:56,559 --> 00:38:57,852
( GASPS )

471
00:39:09,447 --> 00:39:11,366
( GASPS )

472
00:39:24,087 --> 00:39:26,339
CLAIRE : ( ON PHONE ) Her nose is broken in two places .

473
00:39:26,423 --> 00:39:28,550
- She may need surgery . - AMELIA : I 'll pay for everything .

474
00:39:28,633 --> 00:39:30,302
CLAIRE : You can 't even pay your own bills .

475
00:39:30,385 --> 00:39:31,678
Look , I really have to go .

476
00:39:31,761 --> 00:39:35,473
AMELIA : Claire , I think someone is stalking me and Samuel .

477
00:39:35,557 --> 00:39:36,850
CLAIRE : What ?

478
00:39:36,933 --> 00:39:38,893
AMELIA : A book turned up at our place .

479
00:39:38,977 --> 00:39:42,522
I threw it away but somebody glued it back together

480
00:39:42,606 --> 00:39:44,316
and put it on our doorstep .

481
00:39:44,399 --> 00:39:47,736
CLAIRE : Amelia , I just can 't help you right now .

482
00:39:47,819 --> 00:39:50,697
I don 't expect you to help . I just wanted ...

483
00:39:50,780 --> 00:39:52,949
CLAIRE : If you 're that worried , you should go to the police .

484
00:39:53,033 --> 00:39:56,077
- I have to go . - ( HANGS UP )

485
00:40:12,677 --> 00:40:14,512
