486
00:40:14,596 --> 00:40:16,514
Claire !

487
00:40:18,183 --> 00:40:19,768
Hello ?

488
00:40:21,227 --> 00:40:25,649
( RASPY VOICE ) Mmm , Babadook ...

489
00:40:25,732 --> 00:40:30,028
dook ... dook .

490
00:40:31,905 --> 00:40:34,282
