491
00:40:36,242 --> 00:40:39,079
Hi .

492
00:40:39,162 --> 00:40:43,041
I want to report someone stalking me and my child .

493
00:40:43,124 --> 00:40:44,376
Can you tell us what happened ?

494
00:40:44,459 --> 00:40:47,337
Somebody sent me a children 's book .

495
00:40:47,420 --> 00:40:49,047
