499
00:40:56,721 --> 00:40:58,640
Can we have a look at the book , please ?

500
00:40:58,723 --> 00:41:00,892
I burnt it .

501
00:41:00,976 --> 00:41:03,603
You burnt it ?

502
00:41:03,687 --> 00:41:04,729
Yes .

503
00:41:04,813 --> 00:41:07,524
Well , unfortunately , there 's nothing we can do about it .

504
00:41:09,150 --> 00:41:12,904
He 's been making phone calls to me as well .

505
00:41:12,988 --> 00:41:14,197
What 's he been saying ?

506
00:41:14,281 --> 00:41:17,867
Nothing , just making these ... noises .

507
00:41:17,951 --> 00:41:19,703
How do you know it 's the same person ?

508
00:41:19,786 --> 00:41:22,163
Because of what he wrote in the book .

509
00:41:22,247 --> 00:41:23,915
The book you burnt ?

510
00:41:23,999 --> 00:41:26,376
Yes .

511
00:41:29,588 --> 00:41:31,214
( SINISTER MUSIC )

512
00:41:42,517 --> 00:41:43,852
OK .

513
00:41:45,228 --> 00:41:47,439
Don 't worry about it .

514
00:41:56,906 --> 00:41:58,950
